#: ../../source/unit/servos8_v2.rst:4 daa8efd905294c349076dd9d03d2eb73
msgid "8Servos2 Unit"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/unit/servos8_v2.rst:10 bdffa4321c344cc98744839c0e0d71c7
msgid ""
"The ``Servos8V2Unit`` class controls the Unit 8Servos2-I2C over I2C. The "
"device provides eight configurable channels for GPIO input, GPIO output, "
"ADC, servo, RGB, and PWM operation. It also provides power monitoring and "
"device information APIs."
msgstr ""
"``Servos8V2Unit`` 类通过 I2C 控制 Unit 8Servos2-I2C。设备提供 8 个可配置通"
"道，支持 GPIO 输入、GPIO 输出、ADC、舵机、RGB 和 PWM 操作，同时提供电源监测和"
"设备信息 API。"

#: ../../source/unit/servos8_v2.rst:15 e7cf9d6c5fd8448d96dbb7feec60c646
msgid "Support the following products:"
msgstr "支持以下产品:"

#: ../../source/unit/servos8_v2.rst:17 d3839547f1bf43b59286bb9abee100f6
msgid "|Unit 8Servos2-I2C|"
msgstr ""

