#: ../../source/unit/servos8_v2.rst:48 419de6cce9aa4574aa9d8ced2091b65c
msgid ""
"This example initializes Unit 8Servos2-I2C for servo control. Button A "
"selects a channel or the all-channel option. Buttons B and C increase or "
"decrease the servo angle in 10-degree steps. The screen displays the "
"selected channel and current angle."
msgstr ""
"本示例初始化 Unit 8Servos2-I2C 以控制舵机。按键 A 选择单个通道或全部通道，按"
"键 B 和 C 以 10 度为步长增大或减小舵机角度。屏幕显示当前选中的通道和角度。"

